{"book":"hono","chapter":"concepts","chapterTitle":"المفاهيم","slug":"benchmarks","title":"معايير الأداء","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"الموجهات","text":"الموجهات"},{"depth":3,"id":"على-nodejs","text":"على Node.js"},{"depth":3,"id":"على-bun","text":"على Bun"},{"depth":2,"id":"cloudflare-workers","text":"Cloudflare Workers"},{"depth":2,"id":"deno","text":"Deno"},{"depth":2,"id":"bun","text":"Bun"}],"html":"<p>الاختبارات المعيارية (Benchmarks) مجرد اختبارات معيارية، لكنها مهمة لنا.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الموجهات\">الموجهات</h2>\n<p>قمنا بقياس سرعات مجموعة من موجِّهات JavaScript.\nعلى سبيل المثال، <code>find-my-way</code> موجّه سريع جدًا يُستخدم داخل Fastify.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>@medley/router</li>\n<li>find-my-way</li>\n<li>koa-tree-router</li>\n<li>trek-router</li>\n<li>express (يتضمن المعالجة)</li>\n<li>koa-router</li>\n</ul>\n<p>أولًا، سجّلنا التوجيه (routing) التالي على كلٍ من موجّهاتنا (routers).\nهذه مشابهة لتلك المستخدمة في العالم الحقيقي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Route</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">routes</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Route</span>[] = [\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/comments&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/avatar&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/lookup/username/:username&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/lookup/email/:address&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/event/:id&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/event/:id/comments&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/event/:id/comment&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/map/:location/events&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/status&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/very/deeply/nested/route/hello/there&#x27;</span> },\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/static/*&#x27;</span> },\n]\n</code></pre>\n<p>ثم أرسلنا الطلب (Request) إلى نقاط النهاية كما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Route</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">routes</span>: (<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Route</span> &amp; { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> })[] = [\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;short static&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;static with same radix&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/comments&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dynamic route&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/lookup/username/hey&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;mixed static dynamic&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/event/abcd1234/comments&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;post&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/event/abcd1234/comment&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;long static&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/very/deeply/nested/route/hello/there&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;wildcard&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/static/index.html&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n]\n</code></pre>\n<p>لنرَ النتائج.</p>\n<h3 id=\"على-nodejs\">على Node.js</h3>\n<p>تُظهر لقطات الشاشة التالية النتائج على Node.js.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench01.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench02.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench03.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench04.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench05.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench06.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench07.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench08.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"على-bun\">على Bun</h3>\n<p>تُظهر اللقطات التالية النتائج على Bun.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench09.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench10.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench11.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench12.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench13.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/hono/bench16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"cloudflare-workers\">Cloudflare Workers</h2>\n<p><strong>Hono هو الأسرع</strong>، مقارنةً بالموجّهات (routers) الأخرى لـ Cloudflare Workers.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>الجهاز: Apple MacBook Pro، 32 GiB، M1 Pro</li>\n<li>Scripts: <a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/tree/main/benchmarks/handle-event\">benchmarks/handle-event</a></li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code>Hono x 402,820 ops/sec ±4.78% (80 runs sampled)\nitty-router x 212,598 ops/sec ±3.11% (87 runs sampled)\nsunder x 297,036 ops/sec ±4.76% (77 runs sampled)\nworktop x 197,345 ops/sec ±2.40% (88 runs sampled)\nFastest is Hono\n✨  Done in 28.06s.\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"deno\">Deno</h2>\n<p><strong>Hono هو الأسرع</strong>، مقارنةً بأطر عمل أخرى لـ Deno.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>الجهاز: Apple MacBook Pro، 32 GiB، M1 Pro، Deno v1.22.0</li>\n<li>Scripts: <a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/tree/main/benchmarks/deno\">benchmarks/deno</a></li>\n<li>Method: <code>bombardier --fasthttp -d 10s -c 100 'http://localhost:8000/user/lookup/username/foo'</code></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>الإطار</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">الإصدار</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">النتائج</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hono</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">3.0.0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>الطلبات/ثانية: 136112</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fast</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">4.0.0-beta.1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">الطلبات/ثانية: 103214</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Megalo</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">0.3.0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">الطلبات/ثانية: 64597</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Faster</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">5.7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">الطلبات/ثانية: 54801</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oak</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">10.5.1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">الطلبات/ثانية: 43326</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opine</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2.2.0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">الطلبات/ثانية: 30700</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>نتيجة معيار أداء أخرى: <a href=\"https://github.com/denosaurs/bench\">denosaurs/bench</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"bun\">Bun</h2>\n<p>Hono هو أحد أسرع الأطر لـ Bun.\nيمكنك رؤيته أدناه.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SaltyAom/bun-http-framework-benchmark\">SaltyAom/bun-http-framework-benchmark</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}